BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rethymno-rethymno-rethymno-carnival-grand-parade-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270314
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270315
SUMMARY:Rethymno Carnival (grand parade)
LOCATION:Rethymno\, Crete (Rethymno)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Crete's biggest carnival\, running the whole Triodion with a treasure hunt\, a night parade and a children's parade\, and peaking on Cheese Sunday (the day before Clean Monday) with the grand parade along the waterfront: in 2026\, 28 floats and about 11\,000 participants\, ending in fireworks. Hotels in the old town book out for that weekend\; the parade starts mid-afternoon and the streets around the harbour close from midday.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rethymno/#rethymno-rethymno-carnival-grand-parade
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rethymno/#rethymno-rethymno-carnival-grand-parade
END:VEVENT
