BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rethymno-gerani-clean-monday-customs-gerani-and-armenoi-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270315
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270316
SUMMARY:Clean Monday customs\, Gerani and Armenoi
LOCATION:Gerani\, Crete (Rethymno)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Rethymno carnival closes on Clean Monday in two villages just outside town: Gerani (west\, on the coast road) and Armenoi (south\, on the Spili road) stage the old Cretan Lenten customs\, mock weddings and satirical skits\, with lagana\, olives\, taramas and wine for everyone and lyra players in the square. Go around midday\; both are 10–15 minutes from Rethymno.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rethymno/#gerani-clean-monday-customs-gerani-and-armenoi
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rethymno/#gerani-clean-monday-customs-gerani-and-armenoi
END:VEVENT
