BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rethymno-myrthios-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiras-myrthios-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiras)\, Myrthios
LOCATION:Myrthios\, Crete (Rethymno)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The balcony village above Plakias holds its feast of the Saviour on the evening of 5 August with a Cretan kompania in the square and food from the cultural association. It is the panigiri for anyone staying on the Plakias coast\; the road up is short but parking in Myrthios is scarce\, so walk up from the first bend or take a taxi.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rethymno/#myrthios-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiras-myrthios
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rethymno/#myrthios-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiras-myrthios
END:VEVENT
