BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rethymno-atsipopoulo-panigiri-of-the-dormition-atsipopoulo-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Dormition\, Atsipopoulo
LOCATION:Atsipopoulo\, Crete (Rethymno)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The large village on the hill just west of Rethymno throws the town's nearest big Dormition glenti on the night of 15 August\, with a headline Cretan singer (Manolis Kontaros in 2019\, Grigoris Samolis for the Asteras club's anniversary in 2025) and tables that are reserved by phone in advance. It is five minutes from the city\, so taxis are easy\; expect it to run past 3 am.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rethymno/#atsipopoulo-panigiri-of-the-dormition-atsipopoulo
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rethymno/#atsipopoulo-panigiri-of-the-dormition-atsipopoulo
END:VEVENT
