BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rethymno-eleftherna-august-panigiri-of-eleftherna-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270816
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270817
SUMMARY:August panigiri of Eleftherna
LOCATION:Eleftherna\, Crete (Rethymno)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The day after the Dormition the Eleftherna cultural association holds its glenti at the Panorama centre opposite the archaeological museum\, with two Cretan singers on stage (Tzanidakis and Samolis in 2019). It is a good way to pair a museum visit with an evening of music\; the site is 30 minutes from Rethymno past Arkadi.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rethymno/#eleftherna-august-panigiri-of-eleftherna
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rethymno/#eleftherna-august-panigiri-of-eleftherna
END:VEVENT
